# Rust build artifacts (large — ~1.5 GB)
target/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local agent / editor settings — ignore everything under .claude/ EXCEPT the
# project's shared spec-kit skills.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Agent project-context file — kept local only (lives in
# ~/Documents/PowerRustCOBOL-local-settings/CLAUDE.md), never committed.
CLAUDE.md

# Editor/OS cruft
*.swp
*~

# ── examples/ — the demo projects ────────────────────────────────────────────
# What ships is the SOURCE of a demo: its manifest, forms, COBOL, indexed-file
# definitions, copybooks, Knowledge Base and Assets. Everything below is
# produced by opening or building the project, and is rebuilt on demand.
#
# PowerDemo3 measured 290 MB, of which 254 MB was dist/ + bin/ alone — a
# quarter of a gigabyte that would live in the history for good (operator,
# 2026-09-04).

# Compiled binaries: the built application, and the hand-over bundle beside it.
examples/*/bin/
examples/*/dist/

# Generated COBOL — a build artefact, rewritten on every Build/Run/Check.
examples/*/generated/

# Working folders the IDE creates and empties.
examples/*/debug/
examples/*/temp/

# Knowledge-base indexes: derived from the project's own documents, rebuilt on
# open. The DOCUMENTS are tracked; their embeddings are not.
examples/*/data/*.redb
examples/*/data/*.sqlite
examples/*/data/*chunked.data

# Grace's workflow run records — a log of past agent runs, not project source.
examples/*/agentic_ai/Grace/

# Per-run conversation state.
examples/*/data/grace-conversation.json

# Session handoff notes — working documents, kept on disk, never in the repo.
# (operator, 2026-08-24)
HANDOFF*.md
HANDOFF*.txt
handoff*.md
handoff*.txt
SESSION-HANDOFF*
